# Wave T46 (Inglenook kit): berrybasket — a woven basket heaped with berries (red, blue, gold), seated at the Mart's east-front shoulder (12,4) and the Contest Hall frontage's east shoulder (24,4) — the painting's Mart goods spilled at the shopfront and the bakery's berry trade. Fully opaque: the town grass is baked in (measured #248707, tg-hearthome's rendered flat, #245107 speckle). (NO-SAME-KIT law; WAVE-T46-INGLENOOK-PLAN.md §5.)
